OL,3,GNEWSA'It saved my life': Plea to rescue
OL,4,Athreatened community hub
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharities, community groups and
OL,7,Fbusinesses have been given six months
OL,8,Fto vacate a council-owned building
OL,9,Fdescribed as the "heart" of a Dumfries
OL,10,Fneighbourhood.
OL,12,FDumfries Women's Aid is among groups
OL,13,Fwhich have been given notice to leave
OL,14,Fthe North West Resource Centre in
OL,15,FLincluden.
OL,17,FLocal people told BBC Scotland News the
OL,18,Ffacility, which includes a popular
OL,19,Fcafe, was a vital and popular community
OL,20,Fhub.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
