OL,3,GNEWSA'It saved my life': Plea to rescue
OL,4,Athreatened community hub
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren's charity Aberlour, which took
OL,7,Fon the building after Dumfries and
OL,8,FGalloway Council declared it surplus to
OL,9,Frequirements several years ago, said it
OL,10,Fwas relocating to premises more
OL,11,Fsuitable for supporting children and
OL,12,Ffamilies.
